{"code":"const expected=["PersistentLayer\n|\n|-- DiagramStore                                  main repository facade\n|   |\n|   |-- Project\n|   |   |-- id / name\n|   |   `-- Mapping canvas identities\n|   |\n|   |-- revisionStore: RevisionStore\n|   |   |-- owns immutable DiagramRevision records\n|   |   |-- owns immutable StoredCanvasSnapshot records\n|   |   |-- owns durable DiagramEditContext heads\n|   |   `-- owns CanvasRecord published heads\n|   |\n|   `-- projectCatalogs: ProjectCatalogStore       owns source catalogs and projection relationships\n|       |\n|       |-- projection relationships\n|       |   |-- source / target canvas and revision references\n|       |   `-- links: source evidence -> target tree nodes\n|       |\n|       |-- CompactionCatalog\n|       |   |-- activeByPath[path] ----------------> compactions[id]\n|       |   `-- compactions[id]: FileCompaction\n|       |       |-- source path / source hash\n|       |       |-- startLine / endLine\n|       |       |-- originalLines\n|       |       `-- compactedSource                retained source presentation\n|       |\n|       `-- Operations\n|           |-- saveMappingDiagram(...)\n|           |   `-- calls DiagramEditService.publish(...)\n|           |       |-- Mapping application layer owns reconciliation\n|           |       `-- writes snapshots / published heads through RevisionStore\n|           |\n|           |-- saveProjectedTree(...)\n|           |   `-- DiagramEditService -> revision history + projection relationship.\n|           |\n|           `-- archiveRepresentation(...)\n|               `-- Retire canvas identity while retaining its revision history.\n|\n|-- MappingWorkspaceStore                         owns the saved editing session\n|   |\n|   `-- MappingWorkspaceSnapshot\n|       |-- projectId\n|       |-- activeDocumentId ---------------------> documents[id]\n|       |\n|       `-- documents[]: MappingDocumentSnapshot\n|           |-- document identity / name\n|           |-- canvasId ------------------------> RevisionStore.canvases\n|           |-- editContextId --------------------> RevisionStore.editContexts\n|           |\n|           |-- canvas                            retained panes and controls\n|           `-- viewport                          camera position\n|               |\n|               |-- Open canvas -------> restore or create its editing context.\n|               |-- Publish -----------> reconcile and save through DiagramEditService.\n|               `-- Save workspace ----> context handles + personal view state.\n|\n`-- SearchArtifact persistence                    PROPOSED derived output\n    |\n    |-- DiagramSearchArtifact\n    |   |-- derived from -------------------------> immutable DiagramRevision content\n    |   |-- searchable text                       node labels with original line labels\n    |   `-- row metadata -------------------------> node ID + original text location\n    |\n    |-- Mapped source-file membership\n    |   |-- derived from -------------------------> revision-owned source mappings\n    |   |-- source identity + path                one entry per referenced file\n    |   |-- search scope                          complete file contents\n    |   `-- owners -------------------------------> referencing diagram nodes\n    |\n    `-- Persistence hooks\n        |-- Diagram revision persisted -> derive its SearchArtifact.\n        |-- Context / published bindings -> select active revision search membership.\n        `-- Retire canvas -> remove active membership; retain historical records.", "[P1] RevisionStore: records and relationships\n|-- diagrams[diagramId]\n|   `-- stable identity across edits and forks\n|-- diagramRevisions[revisionId]: DiagramRevision\n|   |-- diagramId / parentIds[] / createdAt\n|   `-- state: DiagramState\n|       |-- content: DiagramContent\n|       |-- sourceContext: DiagramSourceContext\n|       `-- jumps[]\n|-- canvasSnapshots[snapshotId]: StoredCanvasSnapshot\n|   |-- canvasId / parentId? / createdAt\n|   |-- document: instances + connections + shared presentation\n|   `-- diagramBindings[diagramId] -> diagramRevisionId\n|-- editContexts[contextId]: DiagramEditContext\n|   |-- canvasId / basePublishedRevisionId?\n|   |-- baselineSnapshotId: frozen starting state\n|   |-- headSnapshotId: current durable checkpoint\n|   `-- version: concurrency token\n|-- canvases[canvasId]: CanvasRecord\n|   `-- name / publishedRevisionId -> canvas snapshot\n|-- publication receipts\n|   `-- request + applied change versions + resulting revision IDs\n|-- History operations\n|   |-- Diagram edit -> diagram revision + canvas checkpoint\n|   |-- Layout edit -> canvas checkpoint; reuse diagram revisions\n|   |-- Fork -> share immutable baseline; branch on edit\n|   |-- Undo -> earlier checkpoint; subsequent edit keeps old branch\n|   `-- Published revert -> append new revision restoring earlier state\n`-- Migration\n    |-- Extract existing embedded historical diagram snapshots\n    |-- Preserve old appearance and reference relationships\n    `-- Equal ASCII or local names do not establish shared identity", "[P2] DiagramEditService.publish: reconciliation and publication\n|-- publish(context, selectedChanges?)\n|   |-- Check request receipt; completed request returns previous result\n|   |-- Construct selected proposal; exclude unselected edits\n|   |-- Validate dependencies and reviewed change versions\n|   `-- Read current published StoredCanvasSnapshot\n|       |-- Head unchanged -> use proposed result\n|       `-- Head advanced -> DiagramEditService.merge(input)\n|-- merge(input): MergeResult                         BLACK BOX\n|   |-- baseline: captured starting state\n|   |-- current: latest published target state\n|   |-- proposed: selected incoming state\n|   `-- resolutions?: explicit conflict choices\n|-- MergeResult\n|   |-- merged: resulting diagram and canvas state\n|   |-- already-present\n|   `-- conflicted: PendingMerge\n|       |-- mergeId / inputToken\n|       `-- conflicts[]: id / logicalTarget / description\n|-- Resolution\n|   `-- current | proposed | custom domain value\n|       `-- Bound to conflictId and exact inputToken\n|-- Publish independently applicable changes\n|   |-- Validate content and affected references\n|   |-- Recheck published head; if advanced, reconcile again\n|   |-- Persist merged diagram revisions + canvas snapshot\n|   `-- Advance published head with durable application receipt\n`-- Refresh original through resolver\n    |-- Preserve newer live edits and personal view state\n    |-- Conflicts do not discard independent successful changes\n    |-- Unresolved dependencies block dependent changes\n    `-- Merge computes; publish persists and advances saved head"];const ns=nodes.list().nodes.filter(n=>n.kind==='diagram'),es=edges.list().edges;
